 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7PZW7AcYBMwQ7kNvwHAlbof&_nc_oc=AdqQPqTbztlicVNP1vxVPjmKYHhQ0w9B0qFZaJEFnVRUI7KSoa1seIcpEIvVzRpZvbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxQIp3E6qcdc7uWV11SeW4cFtmS5WQfgrHgdg_VhZ1rTw&oe=69CE609E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CNQvAifZDKIQ7kNvwEvz7Ej&_nc_oc=Adov6NhQEmMWklgNwyHLfOGvmOxFwEHaCN1LEHmyfYe3KlyPKU7njObvh0JSw052O5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyddDd6XZM5-17uQkaBJaS5fCAJIlwvaNkKU4E9xo5BZQ&oe=69CE7E41"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o0vH4Buo738Q7kNvwHSVWXA&_nc_oc=Ado_lLbxP_3u-9Jy-hnMbSdXPI1TjL3icfPsSAwO4FUywFp1dIw96LmWbN_oVrvwu-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxk5VPKrxzeE8-f7WpQvr2wSwVRD99dYuJed6FiMzvt6A&oe=69CE5AFE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pFQ3JMHFC58Q7kNvwE3pynv&_nc_oc=AdoRFEfJMfQDKsp7WGaBfK_yG0h3D1uV9h70Giv2oRH1-MKPQ2PTh8Q4ODXsvASrSu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyWDY3NerznloUS0K6IN2_7kjceYPrx9ZSwa60QJHtLtw&oe=69CE5F23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWXRfJ2PVp8Q7kNvwFrDiHJ&_nc_oc=Ados6aJR5wauaHEGeGuHSt6CLUK_01_we--URs-OKBY3chrhjsC5iW8rv44hnzYspQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy9P64ZnhxGfM-WDWQa7s7TJNDAmEeGlEuH1hM07ZY4tg&oe=69CE653B"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con